{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Corlero",
    "steam_appid": 1991350,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991350/extras/938d79852220faba8b2b718d944c4fa4.webp?t=1745600463\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991350/extras/e5a6d9512392a1c84b7d59a1c8c0e147.avif?t=1745600463\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choose between 2 factions, each with 56 units and 72 trait variants, distinct from the other factions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Upgrade your units and construct the best team you can submit on each turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Consult the combat meters and watch battles carefully to evaluate strengths and weaknesses in your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991350/extras/16597308ab6157347d4e7b0cf199c997.webp?t=1745600463\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991350/extras/d81b6a050db56605941dc698ddfd0822.avif?t=1745600463\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use dust to redo battles, swap units into the battlefield from your bench, level up and reposition your team. The dusts of time are finite, so pick your battles carefully...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All units have 3 different traits that enhance their effectiveness in a variety of ways. Both factions have 3 different variants for their traits, causing traits to play differently between games. Choosing unique combinations of traits allows you to customize your team and explore new options. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What's your most important unit? What's your team's strategy? That's entirely up to you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991350/extras/fca8967e2ab3dd2ec12d88a97862ecff.webp?t=1745600463\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991350/extras/8ffd34a9a4d95273cdb947be5f723cc2.avif?t=1745600463\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is unique and presents you with new opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A run lasts a maximum of 24 turns, if you can stave off too many defeats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strive to make it further than you've gone before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to pull off a cool trait combination and turn your melee assassin into an unkillable, healing machine. Or overwhelm your opponents by summoning an endless barrage of terrifying creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek victory and most importantly have fun!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991350/extras/938d79852220faba8b2b718d944c4fa4.webp?t=1745600463\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991350/extras/e5a6d9512392a1c84b7d59a1c8c0e147.avif?t=1745600463\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choose between 2 factions, each with 56 units and 72 trait variants, distinct from the other factions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Upgrade your units and construct the best team you can submit on each turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Consult the combat meters and watch battles carefully to evaluate strengths and weaknesses in your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991350/extras/16597308ab6157347d4e7b0cf199c997.webp?t=1745600463\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991350/extras/d81b6a050db56605941dc698ddfd0822.avif?t=1745600463\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use dust to redo battles, swap units into the battlefield from your bench, level up and reposition your team. The dusts of time are finite, so pick your battles carefully...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All units have 3 different traits that enhance their effectiveness in a variety of ways. Both factions have 3 different variants for their traits, causing traits to play differently between games. Choosing unique combinations of traits allows you to customize your team and explore new options. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What's your most important unit? What's your team's strategy? That's entirely up to you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991350/extras/fca8967e2ab3dd2ec12d88a97862ecff.webp?t=1745600463\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991350/extras/8ffd34a9a4d95273cdb947be5f723cc2.avif?t=1745600463\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is unique and presents you with new opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A run lasts a maximum of 24 turns, if you can stave off too many defeats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strive to make it further than you've gone before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to pull off a cool trait combination and turn your melee assassin into an unkillable, healing machine. Or overwhelm your opponents by summoning an endless barrage of terrifying creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek victory and most importantly have fun!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A fantasy auto-battler with roguelike elements. With 56 units and 72 trait variants in both factions, every run is unique. Construct your best team, manage your economy and choose key battles to retry. How will you sculpt your path to victory?",
